" Markdown. Installed by zvim -s; change it as you like (zvim --help
" explains the format). Words go in groups; each group has a colour in
" zvimrc.
extensions md markdown

span keyword # start
span comment > start
span comment <!-- -->
span string ``` ``` start
span string ` ` oneline
span type ** ** oneline
span type __ __ oneline
span function [ ] oneline
